# ============================================
# Unity Git Attributes
# 确保 Unity YAML 文件使用正确的合并策略
# ============================================

# Unity YAML files
*.unity binary
*.prefab binary
*.asset binary
*.meta binary

# Text files
*.cs text diff=csharp
*.shader text
*.cginc text
*.hlsl text
*.json text
*.xml text
*.md text
*.txt text

# Images
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.psd binary
*.tga binary
*.bmp binary
*.exr binary

# Audio
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.aif binary
*.aiff binary

# Video
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.avi binary

# Fonts
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Compiled
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.exe binary
